  "releaseNotes": "4.2.0: page orientation no longer trusts weak predictions (OrientationMinConfidence, near-empty pages were flipped 180°) and is cross-checked against the per-line reads, re-running the page at the right angle when they disagree; TextMetrics public (font size from a text box) for the searchable PDF/A export in HHO.LV.OCR.Pdf; LVOcrPage.Dispose no longer zeroes the caller's image buffer. 4.1.0: DOCX export keeps the page layout (positioned lines with measured font size and bold, real tables with merged cells, pictures); table rows and merged cells read from the ruling lines in the image; picture regions kept as blocks. 4.0.1:New: page orientation, deskew, text-line orientation, layout, tables, line-level coordinates and confidence, Markdown / row-text export.",
